        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Production</h3>
        <p>Every Long Wallet is made to order and handcrafted individually after your order is placed.</p>
        <p>We do not carry stock or mass produce our products. Each wallet is crafted from start to finish with careful attention to detail, ensuring every piece receives the time it deserves.</p>
