        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">About</h3>
        <p>The Long Wallet is designed as a structured everyday essential—functional, deliberate, and enduring. Crafted entirely by hand from full vegetable-tanned horse culatta, it embraces the natural character of the hide while offering generous storage in a refined silhouette.</p>
        <p>Secured with heavy-duty metal snap buttons and accompanied by a removable chain with a lobster clasp, it can be carried, attached, or worn according to preference. The unfiltered character of the leather ensures every wallet is entirely unique, with natural scars, grain shifts, and markings telling the story of the hide.</p>
        <p>Every piece is handcrafted in our atelier in Singapore.</p>
